    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DungeonSmash is a simple and addictive game where you break blocks in medieval dungeons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The level editor</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Community levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tournaments and prizes for the best maps</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>90+ Achievements</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40+ Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEVEL EDITOR</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play players maps</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Receive ratings and prizes</li></ul><br>Although the game is finished and fully playable, only the first level is available as we plan to release new levels in future free updates.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DungeonSmash is a simple and addictive game where you break blocks in medieval dungeons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/63fdd1027e96ddcf9d8a1f9d0c089398.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The level editor</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Community levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tournaments and prizes for the best maps</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>90+ Achievements</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40+ Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEVEL EDITOR</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.poster.avif?t=1689792311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.webm?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395470/extras/26e62077684640af07df8125e5eb1228.mp4?t=1689792311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play players maps</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Receive ratings and prizes</li></ul><br>Although the game is finished and fully playable, only the first level is available as we plan to release new levels in future free updates.",
